    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d953-a1">

                <pb facs="1101" n="1005" xml:id="pg1005"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. White.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-09-21"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                21, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is desired to send small light-draft gunboat <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Helena</hi> to China for river service, for which purpose she was expressly
                    built. Will sail about October 1, touching at Bermuda, Madeira, and Gibraltar.
                    Ask permission to visit Bermuda and Gibraltar and coal therein, with
                    understanding that the vessel does not reenforce Asiatic Squadron for operations
                    against Spain should hostilities be resumed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
